            <span id="alg3.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg3.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{best\_LLM}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>best_LLM</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{best\_LLM}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> LLM with highest F1 score across OLDs

</div>
<div id="alg3.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg3.l7.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">## persona alignment</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
            LLM<math id="alg3.l8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}_{\textit{O}}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">O</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\textit{O}}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Initialize <span id="alg3.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">best_LLM</span> to discuss <span id="alg3.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">offensive</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
            LLM<math id="alg3.l9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}_{\textit{N}}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">N</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\textit{N}}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Initialize <span id="alg3.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">best_LLM</span> to discuss <span id="alg3.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">non-offensive</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
            LLM<math id="alg3.l10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}_{\textit{Judge}}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Judge</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\textit{Judge}}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Initialize <span id="alg3.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">best_LLM</span> to make final decision

</div>
<div id="alg3.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg3.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> comment <math id="alg3.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∈</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">PoliticalK.O<span id="alg3.l11.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium ltx_font_upright" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.4pt;"><img src="" id="alg3.l11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_missing ltx_missing_image" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span></span> <span id="alg3.l11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg3.l12.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">## rationale generation</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg3.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">summary</span> <math id="alg3.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">summarized source article</span>
</div>
